    reasoning:
      'High inflation (4.2%) detected (World Bank CPI, live). Recommend cUSD savings position on Celo to preserve purchasing power. Inflation: 4.2% (World Bank CPI, live), Top yield: Mento at 12.50% APY ($5.0M TVL, DeFiLlama, live). Sources unavailable this beat: CoinGecko prices — no fallback figures were used.',
